llvm-vle-ppc (11.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package for LLVM with PowerPC VLE (Variable Length Encoding) support
  * Built with PowerPC target enabled for e200z4/e200z6/e200z7 cores
  * Supports powerpc-none-eabivle and powerpc-unknown-linux-gnu VLE triplets
  * Includes Clang frontend and LLD linker with VLE PowerPC support

 -- AutomotiveDevOps <noreply@github.com>  Mon, 03 Nov 2025 11:27:00 -0500

